# GIT-0004: signed-commit enforcement on branch protection.
# Deliberately not required for this single-author portfolio repository.
# Signed commits defend against commit forgery in multi-contributor settings;
# for a solo repo the benefit does not justify the GPG/SSH key-management
# overhead, and enforcing it would block routine solo merges to main.
# Conscious risk acceptance, revisit if the project gains contributors.
GIT-0004
